    442cb56ba2f3ca019097d6652b36e30c876e9dd2318414f3483402e70d2b54ee
  after arm in-process ELF sha256
    1730772b4f7a4f496146ce33b757117d9e85d103276e60a3fbf908a5149f64c2

COMMAND (four passes, balanced order before,after,after,before):
