    FNX_EXPECT_SO=$S/arm_$arm/franken_networkx/_fnx.abi3.so \
    .venv/bin/python bench_genadjdi.py

Each row is perf_harness.paired(): fnx and LIVE networkx 3.6.1 interleaved
inside ONE loop with the order alternated per round, 21 rounds, min-of-3,
bootstrap median CI, plus an arm-specific A/A null on each side. Output is
byte-compared before timing. Replication is the discriminator, not the null:
each arm was visited twice.

